00:03:55.611 --> 00:03:57.508
<v Host>It means to be decided.

00:03:58.108 --> 00:04:07.587
<v Slow>キャプテンの石川祐希選手は30歳で、オリンピックは3回目になります。

00:04:08.388 --> 00:04:14.604
<v Host>The captain, Ishikawa Yuki, is thirty years old. This will be his third Olympics.

00:04:15.204 --> 00:04:17.507
