00:04:17.908 --> 00:04:20.692
<v Host>It means captain — the leader of the team.

00:04:21.291 --> 00:04:37.803
<v Slow>日本の男子バレーボールがオリンピックでメダルを取ったのは、1972年が最後です。次の目標は、ロサンゼルスでのメダルです。

00:04:38.603 --> 00:04:47.819
<v Host>The last time Japan's men's volleyball team won an Olympic medal was in nineteen seventy-two. Their next goal is a medal in Los Angeles.

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.819
