00:07:05.872 --> 00:07:09.423
<v Host>The Los Angeles Olympics, in twenty twenty-eight.

00:07:10.024 --> 00:07:18.711
<v Host>That's all for today. Congratulations to Japan's volleyball team — the road to Los Angeles starts now. See you next time.

00:07:19.312 --> 00:07:21.711
